{
  "name": "congested_1000_3h",
  "description": "真实数据固定随机1000目标，三站三小时，用于检查资源竞争和联合修复收益。",
  "data_root": "data/开运联合",
  "start_utc": "2026-08-04T00:00:00Z",
  "horizon_s": 10800,
  "target_limit": 1000,
  "selection_seed": 20261020,
  "station_ids": ["1", "5", "9"],
  "rules": {
    "min_duration_s": 120,
    "full_duration_s": 240,
    "switch_s": 30,
    "score_mode": "step",
    "objective": "coverage_then_score",
    "repeat_gap_s": null,
    "max_observations_per_target": 1
  },
  "windows": {
    "workers": 1,
    "scan_step_s": 30,
    "target_chunk": 32,
    "time_chunk_s": 21600,
    "root_tolerance_s": 0.01,
    "cache_dir": "outputs/window_cache"
  },
  "seeds": [0, 1, 2],
  "alns_iterations": 100,
  "alns_time_limit_s": 60,
  "development_assumptions": [
    "减少站点和时间范围用于制造可研究的资源竞争，不代表正式全规模成绩",
    "2026-08-04 UTC起始为靠近TLE历元的开发选择",
    "每目标最多一次，覆盖优先、得分次之；重复计分与目标函数尚待官方确认",
    "联合修复收益必须实测，不预设其存在或可由学习提升"
  ]
}
